{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792665554998,"sessionID":"ses_e9cd17f69ffeURpERydLf268dF","part":{"partID":"prt_163318f20001ECvhI14GjrhRT5","sessionID":"ses_e9cd17f69ffeURpERydLf268dF","messageID":"msg_16331338a001GYRdyL2eDbzHss","type":"tool","id":"call_00_jCgHnZMymoTJGZny13Nx5592","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /home/baptistefaisy/aiven-kafka-demo && ./trace-dump --help 2>&1 | head -40; echo \"=== logs dir ===\"; ls -la ~/logs 2>/dev/null | head; echo \"=== grep trace id in ~/logs ===\"; grep -rl \"f46dbfd9e79354dd907419c46f2468c8\" ~/logs 2>/dev/null | head"},"output":"usage: trace-dump [-h] [--detectors] [--list] [--json] [--prefix PREFIX]\n                  [trace_id]\n\npreuve brute d'une trace (spans, logs, metriques, detecteurs)\n\npositional arguments:\n  trace_id         trace id a dumps\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help       show this help message and exit\n  --detectors      verdict des 3 detecteurs\n  --list           liste les traces\n  --json           sortie JSON\n  --prefix PREFIX  prefixe de topics\n=== logs dir ===\ntotal 732\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 baptistefaisy baptistefaisy    500 Oct 22 09:33 .\ndrwx------ 1 baptistefaisy baptistefaisy   1466 Oct 22 12:38 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 baptistefaisy baptistefaisy  11210 Oct 21 11:48 api-audit.log\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 baptistefaisy baptistefaisy    186 Oct 21 12:13 cleanup-20261021-121324\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 baptistefaisy baptistefaisy     40 Oct 21 12:14 cleanup-20261021-131324\n-rw-r--r-- 1 baptistefaisy baptistefaisy 120942 Oct 21 14:25 decision-router.log\n-rw-r--r-- 1 baptistefaisy baptistefaisy   8257 Oct 22 10:01 historique-pg.log\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 baptistefaisy baptistefaisy   3846 Oct 22 12:35 incidents\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 baptistefaisy baptistefaisy 525130 Oct 22 12:39 kafka-health.log\n=== grep trace id in ~/logs ===\n/home/baptistefaisy/logs/incidents/20261022-103553-f46dbfd9-debug-historique.log\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{