{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792665743324,"sessionID":"ses_e9cd17f69ffeURpERydLf268dF","part":{"partID":"prt_163341493001e57honaAErj9mr","sessionID":"ses_e9cd17f69ffeURpERydLf268dF","messageID":"msg_16333d5aa001zpY2dn1FO9tfSQ","type":"tool","id":"call_01_pD2OXAoCzqGhcxvntrAA3744","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /home/baptistefaisy/aiven-kafka-demo && grep -rn \"TraceId\\|TraceID\" --include='*.py' tools/emit_db_errors.py | head -20; echo \"=== kafka topics ===\"; ./kafka-health 2>&1 | head -40","timeout":120000},"output":"243:    TraceId (cle Kafka). `agent.scenario` vaut `db/<error_type>` pour qu'on\n277:        \"TraceId\": trace_id,\n294:        \"TraceId\": trace_id,\n=== kafka topics ===\nERREUR : broker injoignable sur 46.101.146.123:21505,64.226.91.132:21505,kafka-1687d005-baptiste-c04f.j.aivencloud.com:21505 : KafkaError{code=_TRANSPORT,val=-195,str=\"Failed to get metadata: Local: Broker transport failure\"} -> verifie le service Aiven (avn service get <service>), le port dans components[], les identifiants (KAFKA_USERNAME/KAFKA_PASSWORD) et l'ACL Describe\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"243:    TraceId (cle Kafka). `agent.scenario` vaut `db/<error_type>` pour qu'on\n277:        \"TraceId\": trace_id,\n294:        \"TraceId\": trace_id,\n=== kafka topics ===\nERREUR : broker injoignable sur 46.101.146.123:21505,64.226.91.132:21505,kafka-1687d005-baptiste-c04f.j.aivencloud.com:21505 : KafkaError{code=_TRANSPORT,val=-195,str=\"Failed to get metadata: Local: Broker transport failure\"} -> verifie le service Aiven (avn service get <service>), le port dans components[], les identifiants (KAFKA_USERNAME/KAFKA_PASSWORD) et l'ACL Describe\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/baptistefaisy/aiven-kafka-demo && grep -rn \\\"TraceId\\\\|TraceID\\\" --include='*.py'